v1.00 - 2026-09-05
	 Initial Release

v1.01 - 2026-09-05
	 Fixed decoder starvation by increasing decode pipeline depth

V1.10 - 2026-09-07
	 Change from multi-threaded CPU to GPU accelerated NV12->RGBA conversion 
	 Color conversion to BT.709, more accurate for HD h264 streams
	 Change stream overlays from CPU blit into frame buffer to GPU alpha blend
	 Updated stream statistics to show total frame time.

V1.11 - 2026-09-08
	 Fixed an empty host list bug which resulted in button presses not working
	 